===Interjection===
{{en-interj}}

# {{lb|en|sometimes|humorous}} {{ngd|Used to show that the speaker feels [[distress]] or [[misery]].}}
#* {{RQ:KJV|Psalms|120|5||'''Woe is me''', that I sojourn in Mesech, that I dwell in the tents of Kedar!}}

